speechtext:
Was it not prior to the time the permit system was brought into force?
Mr. MaeKINNON (Edmonton West): Yes;
I was just coming to that. They asked for permission to make this sale, and we refused. This was before the permit system was brought into force. They wanted to make sure that they would be able to get wheat to conclude the sale; therefore they asked us, and we told them that we would do nothing to assist them. Afterwards the permit system was put into force, and since then a permit _was issued for the sale of a certain quantity of wheat in order to fill out a firm transaction that had been completed between the Canadian exporting company and their agents.
